LAMMPS (3 Mar 2020)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread. (../comm.cpp:94)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# LAMMPS input: r13_e10_b1  (R13 reservoir-filling test, D55/PLAN.md: field e10)
# Engine: LAMMPS 3 Mar 2020 (cluster module lammps/3Mar20-icc.2022, ime001;
#   8-rank MPI). ALL 18 R13 jobs run on this ONE build (T1).
#   Local smoke validation only: 22 Jul 2025 Update 4, lmp -var smoke 1.
# Model: pilot model (owner_inputs.md D37 note): OPLS-AA-based rigid
#   molecules from Nutakki 2023 Tables II-III, Werder sp2-C tube carbons,
#   Lorentz-Berthelot mixing (recorded deviation), full +-1 ion charges.
# System: r13_r13_b1 -- armchair (16,16) CNT, 98.4 A (ncell 40), packed pore
#   at the CORRECTED open-tube uptake: 125 EC / 58 EMC / 24 LiPF6 (Q2 per-A
#   fc8bec2 x 98.4; salt neutralized at the rounded mean of the measured
#   Li+ 26.3 / PF6- 20.9 -- the imbalance is a Q2 finding, not the build;
#   PLAN.md sections 1).
# Thermostat: ONE Langevin scheme for every mobile atom, damping 1 ps:
#   fix rigid/nve molecule langevin (NON-distributed variant per f9cae3f)
#   + fix nve + fix langevin (Li+); no Nose-Hoover.
# Protocol (the committed Z3 protocol, r13/PLAN.md section 4 verbatim):
#   fresh packed build -> 100 ps 10->300 K ramp (zero field) +
#   900 ps zero-field equilibration [per-build seeds: the build's
#   three field jobs reach the IDENTICAL ladder-t=0 state] -> field on at
#   ladder t = 0, 1000 ps settle (dump every 10 ps) -> 2 x 6000 ps
#   production blocks dumped every 1 ps (block A = 0-6000 ps,
#   block B = 6000-12000 ps) -> write_data final.data.
#   13 ns ladder + 1 ns thermalization = 14 ns. Block 6 ns = 2 x tau_M
#   (cnt16 @0.01 V/A) = 2 x 3.01 ns (Stage A).
# Seeds (PLAN.md section 5): velocity create 20291152; ramp 20291221/20291222;
#   equil 20291223/20291224 (per-build); ladder 20292411/20292412 (per-job).
# Dumps: every 1 ps (settle: every 10 ps), dump_modify format float
#   %.10g, with image flags. Thermo: every 1 ps, flushed.
# R13 pre-registration: the D39 analysis call and the 0.01 V/A
# decision rule are fixed in r13/PLAN.md (written before any job ran).
#

units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p

read_data       system.data
  orthogonal box = (-20.8502 -20.8502 0) to (20.8502 20.8502 98.4)
  1 by 2 by 4 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  4872 atoms
  scanning bonds ...
  6 = max bonds/atom
  reading bonds ...
  2206 bonds
  6 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
  5 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
  9 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
  11 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.00145386 secs
  read_data CPU = 0.0549474 secs

pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long 12.0
pair_modify     mix arithmetic tail no
kspace_style    pppm 0.0001
pair_coeff      1 1 0.085300 3.4000
pair_coeff      2 2 0.104995 3.7500
pair_coeff      3 3 0.170005 3.0000
pair_coeff      4 4 0.065989 3.5000
pair_coeff      5 5 0.209990 2.9600
pair_coeff      6 6 0.015010 2.4200
pair_coeff      7 7 0.029995 2.5000
pair_coeff      8 8 0.066000 3.5000
pair_coeff      9 9 0.165057 1.5100
pair_coeff      10 10 0.200000 3.7400
pair_coeff      11 11 0.060994 3.1180

bond_style       harmonic
bond_coeff      1 0.0 1.0
special_bonds   lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.0

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes exclude molecule/intra all

group           tube type 1
2560 atoms in group tube
group           mobile subtract all tube
2312 atoms in group mobile
group           li type 9
24 atoms in group li
group           bodies subtract mobile li
2288 atoms in group bodies
fix             frz tube setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0

compute         keb bodies ke
compute         keli li ke
variable        Tmob equal 2.0*(c_keb+c_keli)/(1311*0.0019872041)

timestep        1.0

# smoke self-test:  lmp -var smoke 1 -in in.lammps
variable        smoke index 0
if "${smoke} == 1" then "variable nramp equal 100000" "variable nequil equal 50000" "variable nsettle equal 500" "variable nblockA equal 500" "variable nblockB equal 500" else "variable nramp equal 100000" "variable nequil equal 900000" "variable nsettle equal 1000000" "variable nblockA equal 6000000" "variable nblockB equal 6000000"
variable nramp equal 100000
variable nequil equal 50000
variable nsettle equal 500
variable nblockA equal 500
variable nblockB equal 500

thermo          1000
thermo_style    custom step atoms v_Tmob temp pe etotal press vol
thermo_modify   flush yes

velocity        mobile create 10.0 20291152 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

# --- stage 1: 100 ps ramp 10 -> 300 K, zero field (per-build seeds)
fix             thb bodies rigid/nve molecule langevin 10.0 300.0 1000 20291221
207 rigid bodies with 2288 atoms
fix             thl li nve
fix             thla li langevin 10.0 300.0 1000 20291222
run             ${nramp}
run             100000
